# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Municipality identity (name, coordinates, domain, branding) does NOT belong
# here — it lives in config/lgu.config.json, read through src/lib/lgu-config.ts.
#
# Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* values reach the browser. Never put a secret behind
# that prefix.

# Base URL used by Playwright when running E2E against a deployed target.
# PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
